      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah, i know people say that, but \"making noise\" feels so forced. it feels like we're all just pretending there's a purpose because the alternative is too scary to face. if the universe doesn't care, and in a billion years no one even remembers we existed, why does the struggle even matter? it just seems like a lot of unnecessary effort for nothing.",
